    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Amanda is put in charge of watching her nephew Cedric for a few days, she expects a relaxing, enjoyable visit, but Cedric's boundless energy and dreams of heroism soon leave her exhausted. In an effort to settle him down, she convinces him to read a book with her - a fairy tale called &quot;Hansel and Gretel.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But books have power, and their peaceful reading experience turns into unexpected peril when Amanda and Cedric are both pulled into the world of the book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tRevisit the popular fairy tale with a new twist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tExciting match-3 puzzles to gather the resources you need</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\t5 chapters to follow her journey every step of the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tJoin Amanda and Cedric on in an adventure they never forget </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tExciting characters and story take the stage for this adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
